{"title":"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 32","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_32\">Problem 32</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 32\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The factors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/9/b59614b95be8dca21062d2528d2245695b86ff87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^4+64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"58\" height=\"16\" /> are: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/b/deb6223377569e64ed168b5bc8b600f2ace59b13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ (x^2+8)^2\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ (x^2+8)(x^2-8)\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ (x^2+2x+4)(x^2-8x+16)\\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ (x^2-4x+8)(x^2-4x-8)\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ (x^2-4x+8)(x^2+4x+8)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"584\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that: \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/d/7ddecedeb7ce098b1520a34cd963f556fec72566.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} x^4+64  &amp;= x^4+2^6 \\\\ \t&amp;= x^4+4\\cdot 2^4 \\end{align*}\" width=\"159\" height=\"44\" />\n</p><p>So, using the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Sophie_Germain_Identity\" title=\"Sophie Germain Identity\">Sophie Germain Identity</a>, we can factor the expression as:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/2/ba29a053c48d4e0bcd565c75acdf5ab0f601a470.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} x^4+64  &amp; = x^4+4\\cdot 2^4\\\\ \t&amp; = (x^2+2\\cdot2^2-4x)(x^2+2\\cdot2^2+4x)\\\\         &amp; = (x^2-4x+8)(x^2+4x+8) \\end{align*}\" width=\"350\" height=\"75\" />\nSo it is clear that our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/f/6bfc0829f3f29bbf35d0a861644e00cfef0f50ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"39\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME\" title=\"1954 AHSME\">1954 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1954 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1954\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 31\">Problem 31</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 33\">Problem 33</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a 